     "id": 1328460,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">7</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The variable <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">str_var</code> contains 1 space. Spaces are considered characters. Spaces are treated the same as other characters and so need to be counted."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328461,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "Eight characters exist in the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">str_var</code>. Iterating over all characters and incrementing the value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count</code> variable at each iteration results in the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">count's</code> value of <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328462,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">9</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The initialization value for the count variable equals 0, and the value increments by one in each loop's iteration."
    }
